# Commands run by the launchd job com.hackios.demo (see com.hackios.demo.plist).
# The network (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.net, with a kernel that has en0: under QEMU, QEMU_NET=1): the
# interface as the kernel has it, then configured by configd's IPConfiguration over DHCP, a name
# resolved, a page fetched over plain TCP and over CFNetwork's HTTPS. See src/net_test.m.
/hackios/bin/net_test show dhcp en0 waitaddr en0 40 store
/hackios/bin/net_test resolve example.com tcp example.com 80 reach example.com
/hackios/bin/net_test fetch https://example.com/ fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
